# Repository root: uv run --project tests --locked --extra hardware --env-file tests/.env python tests/run_hardware.py ...
# Copy this file to tests/.env. The address is the only setting: the probe, the chip and the probe's memo records
# say the rest (tests/harness/place.py). An OEP port, or a WCH-Link:
CH32RV_PROBE=oep://30eda0e31108/x035
# CH32RV_PROBE=wchlink://FB868F068059
# On a WCH-Link only (it keeps no record): the part when the chip ID leaves several (CH32V103 C8T6 / R8T6).
# CH32RV_CHIP=CH32V103C8T6
OEP_HW_RESULTS=work/hardware-results
# --probe / --out override these. No minimum probe firmware and no implicit probe update or Flash backup.
